OL,3,AUkraine says Starlink still restricted
OL,4,Aafter Trump says limits lifted
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine is still recording issues with
OL,7,Fthe Starlink internet network, sources
OL,8,Fwithin the defence ministry say, after
OL,9,FDonald Trump said limits had been
OL,10,Freversed by Elon Musk who owns the
OL,11,Fsatellite system.
OL,13,FThe sources told the BBC that instances
OL,14,Fof drones experiencing connection loss
OL,15,Fat speeds of 161km/h (100mph) were
OL,16,Fbeing recorded, hampering military
OL,17,Foperations.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
